# Dusty Git's vim modes and the editor's leader (scripts/.vim-run.sh shots): the mode chip in
# NORMAL, VISUAL (a line range in the reader) and INSERT (the commit message box), a Visual
# selection inside the box, the which-key box after the leader, and the list filter and the
# `:` prompt in NORMAL.
until Changes
wait 300
shot normal
key v
wait 900
key j j j j
wait 300
type V
wait 300
key j j
wait 400
shot visual
key escape
wait 300
key 2
wait 300
key s
wait 1200
key c
wait 700
type Explain the modes
wait 400
shot insert
key escape
wait 200
type 0wve
wait 400
shot box-visual
key escape
wait 200
key escape
wait 400
key space
wait 500
shot leader
key e
wait 600
shot rail-hidden
key space e
wait 400
key 2
wait 300
type /
wait 300
type notes
wait 400
key escape
wait 300
type b
wait 300
shot filter-normal
key escape
wait 400
type :
wait 300
type tutor git
wait 300
key escape
wait 200
type 0w
wait 300
shot command-normal
key escape
wait 200
key escape
wait 300
